cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "AERON: forecasting daily PM2.5 in Tashkent with prediction ranges (replay)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Rashidovich"
    given-names: "Jushkinbek"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jushkinbekrashidovich/Aeron"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Research code for one-to-three-day forecasts of the daily mean PM2.5 at the US Diplomatic Post
  monitor in Tashkent, with conformal prediction ranges and exceedance probabilities, evaluated with
  leak-free walk-forward testing. Single station; the measured series ends in February 2025.
keywords:
  - air quality
  - PM2.5
  - forecasting
  - Tashkent
  - conformal prediction
